---
permalink: /en/tour/recorrido/
title: "Route & itinerary"
description: "The Palomino Islands tour route: La Punta, El Camotal, San Lorenzo, El Frontón, Cavinzas and Palomino. History and wildlife at every stop."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/en/tour/">The Tour</a><span>›</span> Route</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Route</p>
    <h1>Six stops, one unforgettable voyage</h1>
    <p class="lead">Each departure crosses Callao bay — its history and its wildlife — all the way to the Palomino Islands.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <div class="embed">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ site.video.incas }}" title="Palomino Islands tour route — video" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="embed-caption">Watch the journey on video — a report by the <strong>{{ site.video.incasChannel }}</strong> channel. Each stop of the route is detailed below.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid cols-2">
      {% for stop in site.route %}
      <article class="card card--top reveal"><div class="card__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Stop {{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3>{{ stop.en }}</h3>
        <p>{{ stop.desc_en }}</p>
      </div></article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <h3>Duration &amp; logistics</h3>
      <p>Approximate duration: <strong>4 hours</strong>. <strong>Daily departures by reservation</strong> (Mon–Fri 11:30 a. m.; Sat, Sun &amp; holidays 10:00 a. m.). Boarding is from our private pier in La Punta, Callao; the exact address is shared once your booking is confirmed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
